flowchart TD
    A([User Requisition / ERP Sync]) --> B[Unified Ingestion Service]
    B --> C[Data Quality & Validation Filter]
    C --> D[Text Normalizer & Abbreviation Expander]
    D --> E[Domain NER & Attribute Extractor]
    E --> F[Rule-Based Technical Filter Engine]
    
    F --> G[Bi-Encoder Dense Vector Generation]
    G --> H[(PostgreSQL 16 + pgvector HNSW Index)]
    H --> I[Top-50 Semantic Candidate Retrieval]
    
    I --> J[Cross-Encoder ML Re-Ranker]
    J --> K[Deterministic Physical Compatibility Matrix]
    K --> L[Integrated Confidence Calculation Engine]
    
    L --> M[SHAP Feature Attribution Engine]
    M --> N{Confidence >= 0.90?}
    
    N -- Yes --> O[Auto-Link to Golden CNMC Code]
    N -- 0.60 to 0.89 --> P[Human-in-the-Loop Maker-Checker Queue]
    N -- < 0.60 --> Q[Generate New CNMC Candidate Proposal]
    
    P --> R[Domain Expert Review on Desktop / Mobile]
    R -- Approved --> O
    R -- Refined --> S[Adjust Attributes & Link]
    R -- Rejected --> Q
    
    O --> T[Publish to Master DB & Ledger]
    S --> T
    Q --> T
    
    T --> U[Event Stream -> Kafka Topics]
    U --> V[Procurement Intelligence & Disparity Engine]
    U --> W[Alert & Notification Engine]
    U --> X[Audit Trail -> PostgreSQL + Hyperledger]
    
    V --> Y[Dormant / Duplicate / Aggregation Alerts]
    W --> Z([Web Desktop / Mobile Real-Time Dispatch])
